## Intent
Exercise "rectangles": implement `count`. Count the rectangles in an ASCII diagram like the one below. ```text +--+ ++  | +-++--+ |  |  | +--+--+ ``` The above diagram contains these 6 rectangles: ```text +-----+ |     | +-----+ ``` ```text +--+ |  | |  | |  | +--+ ``` ```text +--+ |  | +--+ ``` ```text +--+ |  | +--+ ``` ```text +--+ |  | +--+ ``` ```text ++ ++ ``` You may assume that the input is always a proper rectangle (i.e. the length of every line equals the length of the first line).

